  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/679/236/menulogue_banner.png\" width=\"1100\" height=\"270\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/503/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"Fabric\" width=\"105\" height=\"28\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mrcrayfish.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/500/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的網站\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/MrCrayfishMinecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/499/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的 YouTube\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/336389026586165261?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&logoColor=902121\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的 Discord\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>📖 關於：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Menulogue 是一個簡單的橋接模組，讓 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a> 的設定入口能在 Fabric 平台上與 Catalogue 相容。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">適用於 Minecraft 1.20.4 及以上版本，此模組需要在此處取得 Catalogue 的 Fabric 版本：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/502/908/icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/catalogue\" rel=\"nofollow\">Catalogue</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">適用於 Minecraft 1.20.3 及以下版本，此模組需要在此處取得 Catalogue 的 Fabric 版本：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/502/908/icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/catalogue-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Catalogue (Fabric)</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/502/822/menuloguescreenshot.png\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">🙋&zwj;♀️ <strong>需要協助？加入官方 Discord 伺服器：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留言區不太適合提供技術支援，請加入官方 Discord 伺服器。您可以在這裡獲得安裝與設定模組的協助、解決遊戲崩潰問題等！此外，您還能第一時間獲取模組更新與開發進度消息。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/794/808/img.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"195\" height=\"28\"></span></a></p>",
